    State0 -->|Default / English| State1EN[State 1: English Greeting & Intent]
    
    State1EN -->|Option 1: Book| State2EN[State 2: Service Selection]
    State1EN -->|Option 2: Question| HumanHandoff[Human Handoff / Specialist]
    
    State1UR -->|Option 1: Book| State2UR[State 2: Urdu Service Selection]
