    State3EN --> State4EN[State 4: Offer Available Slots A/B]
    State3UR --> State4UR[State 4: Urdu Offer Available Slots A/B]
    
    State4EN --> State5EN[State 5: Booking Confirmation & Summary]
    State4UR --> State5UR[State 5: Urdu Booking Confirmation & Summary]

